;; expect: main.head1 refused inhabited_default
;; a name ending in `!` reads a default from an Inhabited instance — Lean's get!-style sugar,
;; refused whatever the module's horizon. Here on the E-first route (the typed route's
;; unknown_constant first): the pointer names List.get? and List.getD.
(import Init List.getD)
(fn head1 ((xs (List Nat))) Nat (List.get! xs 0))
